BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Michael Mann's Manhunter: The Final Cut (1986)
DTSTART:20260803T233000Z
DTEND:20260804T014500Z
DTSTAMP:20260803T233000Z
UID:BaYS7gUo4h
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 119 mins (1h59m)\n\nA new 4K Restoration of Michael 
 Mann’s definitive director’s cut. Will Graham (William Petersen)\, a f
 ormer FBI profiler\, is cajoled out of retirement to help an old colleague
  track down a serial killer called "The Tooth Fairy." The question is: can
  they find the man in time to end his killing spree?\n\nhttps://www.siff.n
 et/cinema/in-theaters/michael-manns-manhunter-the-final-cut\n\nEstimated s
 tart: 16:45
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 3\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
